 steps: either serve the change from Watchtower's /designer (bump the pinned build), or have gallery-serve redirect /fabric/* to the watchtower.url origin. Then click the anchor again end to end and confirm the card opens.","judge":"reviewer-judge-t-589-r1-3a6379fe2659:reviewer","judged":"T-589#AC2","meaning":"proceed, and record the guidance against the thing judged","state":"amber","ts":"2026-10-06T09:38:11Z"},"outcome":"amber","reviewer":"reviewer-judge-t-589-r1-3a6379fe2659:reviewer","revision":"1e670215188c9fb38e2868e3eede7df66856d47a","run_id":"run-t-589-1ec58974b6","rung":"rung-1-same-vendor-independent","task":"T-589","ts":"2026-10-06T09:38:11Z","verdict":"amber","worker":"reviewer-judge-t-589-r1-3a6379fe2659"}
